      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Reality Scrubber\n\nAn editable normalized time:mix schedule blends source and generated takes. This is a crossfade compositor, not geometric scene reconstruction or a live draggable frontend slider.\n\nUse short, low-resolution shots first. For tracked silhouettes, use the included SAM2 helper. Connect matching mask batches at the generated-video FPS. Core compositor is capped at 1200 frames and 1080p. These workflows have not been run inside ComfyUI or GPU-generation tested."
      ]
    }
